tyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;endArrow=none;endFill=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#172033;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="viewer" target="a-pacs"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="deny2" value="✕ Public Internet 직접 접근 금지" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;endArrow=none;endFill=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#172033;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="public" target="a-pacs"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="범례  ━ 파란선: 제어·동의·권한   ━ 주황 굵은선: DICOM Pixel Data   ┄ 회색/보라: 선택·확장   ✕ 빨강: 금지   🔒 TLS·mTLS·암호화   ▣ DB: 메타데이터·상태·감사" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="960" width="1870" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notice" value="QR은 의료영상 저장매체가 아니라 환자 동의와 일회용 전송권한을 전달하는 수단이다.  |  원본 DICOM은 A 병원 PACS에 유지되며 중앙 클라우드는 Pixel Data를 영구 저장하지 않는다.&lt;br&gt;B 병원은 인증 의료진의 정책 승인 후 원격조회 또는 선택적 편입을 수행한다.  |  캡스톤 PoC · 합성 데이터 · 실제 병원 운영/실제 PACS 연동/임상진단 아님" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1003" width="1870" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="02_동의_QR_원격조회_편입_상세흐름" name="02_동의_QR_원격조회_편입_상세흐름"><mxGraphModel dx="1920" dy="1080" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1920" pageHeight="1080" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p2-title" value="동의 · QR · 원격조회 · 선택적 PACS 편입 상세흐름" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="1870" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s1" value="1. A 병원 Study 선택&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A Staff → A PACS&lt;br&gt;CT/MRI Study·Series 선택&lt;br&gt;원본은 A PACS 유지" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F1FB;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="120" width="420" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s2" value="2. 환자 동의&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Purpose · Recipient&lt;br&gt;Study/Series Scope · Validity&lt;br&gt;View / Import · Revocation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F1FB;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="120" width="420" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s3" value="3. QR / Ticket 발급&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;opaque ticket · jti/nonce&lt;br&gt;TTL · one-time · institution binding&lt;br&gt;no PII · no DICOM · no key" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F1FB;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="120" width="420" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s4" value="4. B 의료진 인증&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;OIDC/OAuth + MFA&lt;br&gt;principal · organization 검증&lt;br&gt;QR만으로 인증하지 않음" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F1FB;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="120" width="420" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5" value="5. QR 연결 · 정책 평가&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RBAC + ABAC&lt;br&gt;기관·의료진·환자·Study·목적·기간&lt;br&gt;ALLOW / DENY / EXPIRED / REVOKED / CONSUMED" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF0DF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="390" width="420" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s6" value="6. QIDO-RS 검색&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;B Viewer → B Connector&lt;br&gt;Approved Study Metadata&lt;br&gt;허용 Study/Series만 반환" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF0DF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="390" width="420" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s7" value="7. WADO-RS 원격조회&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;B Viewer ↔ B Edge ↔ Relay ↔ A Edge ↔ A PACS&lt;br&gt;On-demand Retrieval · Progressive Loading&lt;br&gt;Instance / Multi-frame Frame · 생영상 Streaming 아님" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF0DF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="390" width="420" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s8" value="8. 선택적 PACS 편입&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Import Request → Separate Storage Policy&lt;br&gt;STOW-RS 또는 Legacy C-STORE&lt;br&gt;Manifest·UID·무결성·부분전송 검증" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF0DF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="390" width="420" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="flow1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor